 "summary": "The register-based virtual machine and bytecode format of the Erlang/OTP runtime (Bogdan/Björn's Erlang Abstract Machine), executing Erlang, Elixir, Gleam and other BEAM languages with lightweight processes, message passing and hot code loading; JIT-compiled by BeamAsm since OTP 24.",
 "status": "active",
